review.","Ground the explanation","Tie generated findings to detector signals and source data so an analyst can inspect the evidence.","Plan around the question","Select aggregation, exploration, feature, model or graph tools based on intent rather than running every tool for every query.","React investigation workspace","FastAPI intent and tool orchestration","DuckDB analytical queries","Rules + statistics + Isolation Forest","Evidence, provenance and human review","React","FastAPI","DuckDB","Python","LLMs","AI","Full-stack"]
